		{
			title: "Rocking The Greed"
			x: -1.25d
			y: -1.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "A Best Laid Plan"
			description: [
				"&dSo Mapped Vaults are a way for us to target very specific, weakened systems inside the FOP Game Server. These systems will be highly guarded, represented by unique mobs you'll only fight in Mapped Vaults."
				""
				"&5To start, ye'll need to make a Greedy Vault Rock. Put it on the Altar and pay for the materials. Note, Bandit, it'll cost ye actual Vault Materials from normal Vaults! When completed, ye'll get a Vault Crystal with the Greedy modifier on it."
				""
				"&dIf you don't have the materials, you can cancel a Greedy Rock Vault by using an Altar Recatalyzer."
				""
				"&5Now, make sure ye have ALL the modifiers filled on the Vault Map (Throw it in the Artisan Station if ye don't!), then use an Anvil to combine the Vault Map and Vault Crystal to get yerself a Mapped Vault."
				""
				"&dBandit, these'll be much more difficult, but in return you'll get loot you can't find in Mapped Vaults, and we'll need that to finally get you out of there."
			]
			dependencies: ["64E050541DAAF09C"]
			hide: true
			id: "1BB69DE20D9F42F7"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4993208738D202D0"
				type: "item"
				item: "woldsvaults:greedy_vault_rock"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "6134CA7EF4DC2BE4"
				type: "item"
				item: "woldsvaults:greedy_vault_rock"
				count: 4
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Task Corrupted Succesfully "
			x: -1.75d
			y: -2.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Falling Apart"
			description: [
				"&5There is a special type of Objective, quite difficult to tackle but the only way to obtain certain materials."
				""
				"&dThey are called Corrupted objectives, and are obtained with a special seal you apply to your Crystal."
				""
				"&5When ye Corrupt a Crystal, the objective will be set to Corrupted, and the Theme will be set to Lost Void."
				""
				"&dWhen you enter this corrupted Vault, your view will be heavily altered. &r&l(This special view can be disabled by hitting F4 if it is causing you visual or performance problems.)"
				""
				"&5Corrupted Objective is a very difficult objective, be warned as the longer ye are in the Vault, the more difficult it will become. I shall not say more than to warn ye of this, it must be experienced first hand."
				""
				"&dThis seal ONLY obtained in Mapped Vaults, but its not the only way to Corrupt your crystal...."
			]
