			subtitle: "Challenging and Rewarding"
			description: [
				"&dGateway Pearls are a special piece of loot that are only obtainable in Mapped Vaults. Don't confuse them with the Gateways Research, though. FOP reused the code between them, which isn't unusual."
				""
				"&5Using an Unidentified Gateway Pearl will get ye a random Gateway Pearl. These Pearls can be used to summmon a wave-based challenge."
				""
				"&dMonsters will spawn in waves, and to win you must kill every monster within a time limit."
				""
				"&5If ye succeed ye will get some special rewards, some ye can only find from a Gateway Pearl."
