				"&dDefeating the Herald will give you a recipe in the Vault Forge for a Zephyr Charm."
				""
				"&5The Zephyr Charm is a powerful charm that boosts yer ground speed a bit, but also boosts yer air speed by much, much more! "
				""
				"&dThis means you can nearly fly through Vaults by bunny hopping!"
				""
				"&5Just be careful! It's very easy to throw yerself into a dangerous situation. Like Lava. "
