		{
			title: "Prestigous Ascent"
			icon: "woldsvaults:chromatic_gold_angel_ring"
			x: -5.0d
			y: -1.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Grinding to Godhood"
			description: [
				"&dUpon defeating the Herald, you unlock one of the major end-game systems : Prestige."
				""
				"&5Prestige enables ye to continue running Vaults, earning XP and loot. When ye gain a level above 100, ye earn a Prestige Point."
				""
				"&dPrestige Points can be used in the new Prestige Power tab in your VH GUI. They are set into tiers, and each power in a tier you unlock requires a power unlocked in a previous tier (Example : to unlock a 3rd Tier3 Power, you must have 3 Tier2 powers and 3 Tier1 Powers unlocked!)"
				""
				"&5Note that Prestige Powers not only require Prestige Points, but also Knowledge Points to unlock, Bandit. Keep collecting that Knowledge."
			]
